MLA Standard: MLA.SPEECH.COM.06
Question:
Which word family is correctly connected?
{
~A. Guess the meaning from sound alone#This choice is too vague or informal for the speech purpose. Choose language that supports audience understanding.
~B. Use the same word form in every sentence#This choice may sound related, but it does not show precise vocabulary control for communication.
=C. communicate, communication, communicator#Correct. This choice uses vocabulary knowledge to make the speech clearer, more precise, and appropriate for the audience.
~D. Choose a made-up word form#This choice weakens the speech because it does not make the speaker language clearer or more precise.
